@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam dpi 150
hide empty description

state "草稿\nDraft" as Draft
state "待审批\nPending" as Pending
state "已批准\nApproved" as Approved
state "候补中\nWaitlisted" as Waitlisted
state "使用中\nInUse" as InUse
state "已完成\nCompleted" as Completed
state "已驳回\nRejected" as Rejected
state "已违约\nNoShow" as NoShow
state "已取消\nCancelled" as Cancelled

[*] --> Draft : 创建预约单

Draft --> Pending : 提交
Pending --> Approved : 审批通过
Pending --> Rejected : 审批驳回
Pending --> Waitlisted : 时段已满
Waitlisted --> Approved : 有人取消

Approved --> InUse : 扫码签到
Approved --> NoShow : 15 分钟未签到
InUse --> Completed : 下机结算

Approved --> Cancelled : 用户取消
Waitlisted --> Cancelled : 用户取消
Approved --> Cancelled : 仪器停用（系统代取消，全额免违约）

Completed --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
NoShow --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]

note right of Pending
  审批期间时段保持锁定，
  审批驳回后释放时段
  并触发候补补位
end note

note right of Waitlisted
  候补队列由 UC-04 维护，
  时段释放时按排队序号
  自动补位转为已批准
end note

note bottom of NoShow
  违约认定由 UC-09 处理：
  扣信用分 10 分，
  低于 60 分暂停预约权限
end note
@enduml
